<title>USA: Chatham, Mass., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Chatham, Mass., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc., said it won $6.900 million of Chatham, Mass., general obligation bonds,  with a true interest cost of 5.197 percent.</p>
</text>
